  "description": "# Suwon\n\n**SWU · v0.3.1**\n\nCustom map of Suwon, Korea, built from official Korean government transport and demographic data.\n\n## Coverage\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Region</strong></td><td>경기도, 서울특별시</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Playable Area</strong></td><td>1,609 km²</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<details>\n<summary>District list (25)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">시군구</th><th align=\"left\">District</th><th align=\"right\">Population</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>경기도</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>고양시 덕양구</td><td>Deogyang-gu Goyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">42,949</td></tr>\n<tr><td>과천시</td><td>Gwacheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">53,888</td></tr>\n<tr><td>광명시</td><td>Gwangmyeong-si</td><td align=\"right\">47,891</td></tr>\n<tr><td>광주시</td><td>Gwangju-si</td><td align=\"right\">188,025</td></tr>\n<tr><td>군포시</td><td>Gunpo-si</td><td align=\"right\">278,293</td></tr>\n<tr><td>성남시 분당구</td><td>Bundang-gu Seongnam-si</td><td align=\"right\">381,602</td></tr>\n<tr><td>성남시 수정구</td><td>Sujeong-gu Seongnam-si</td><td align=\"right\">88,477</td></tr>\n<tr><td>성남시 중원구</td><td>Jungwon-gu Seongnam-si</td><td align=\"right\">1,933,381</td></tr>\n<tr><td>수원시 권선구</td><td>Gwonseon-gu Suwon-si</td><td align=\"right\">564,102</td></tr>\n<tr><td>수원시 영통구</td><td>Yeongtong-gu Suwon-si</td><td align=\"right\">362,105</td></tr>\n<tr><td>수원시 장안구</td><td>Jangan-gu Suwon-si</td><td align=\"right\">501,953</td></tr>\n<tr><td>수원시 팔달구</td><td>Paldal-gu Suwon-si</td><td align=\"right\">235,450</td></tr>\n<tr><td>시흥시</td><td>Siheung-si</td><td align=\"right\">228,733</td></tr>\n<tr><td>안산시 단원구</td><td>Danwon-gu Ansan-si</td><td align=\"right\">144,082</td></tr>\n<tr><td>안산시 상록구</td><td>Sangnok-gu Ansan-si</td><td align=\"right\">507,915</td></tr>\n<tr><td>안양시 동안구</td><td>Dongan-gu Anyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">376,533</td></tr>\n<tr><td>안양시 만안구</td><td>Manan-gu Anyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">213,369</td></tr>\n<tr><td>오산시</td><td>Osan-si</td><td align=\"right\">159,839</td></tr>\n<tr><td>용인시 기흥구</td><td>Giheung-gu Yongin-si</td><td align=\"right\">434,263</td></tr>\n<tr><td>용인시 수지구</td><td>Suji-gu Yongin-si</td><td align=\"right\">431,637</td></tr>\n<tr><td>용인시 처인구</td><td>Cheoin-gu Yongin-si</td><td align=\"right\">255,120</td></tr>\n<tr><td>의왕시</td><td>Uiwang-si</td><td align=\"right\">133,581</td></tr>\n<tr><td>평택시</td><td>Pyeongtaek-si</td><td align=\"right\">183,969</td></tr>\n<tr><td>화성시</td><td>Hwaseong-si</td><td align=\"right\">926,231</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>서울특별시</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>금천구</td><td>Geumcheon-gu</td><td align=\"right\">718</td></tr>\n</table>\n</details>\n\n## Population Summary\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Total Modeled Demand</strong></td><td align=\"right\">2,504,467</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Pops</strong></td><td align=\"right\">55,870</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n## Additional Features\n\n- **Neighborhood Labels** — The map includes municipal and neighborhood labels derived from administrative boundary data.\n\t- 시도 (Si, Do - Metropolitan / Provincial level)\n\t- 시군구 (Si, Gun, Gu - City / County / District level)\n\t- 읍면동 (Eup, Myeon, Dong - Neighborhood level)\n\n## Data Sources\n\n- Korean Transportation Database (Korea Transport Institute, KOTI) (ktdb.go.kr)\n- V-world (Ministry of Land, Infrastructure and Transport, MOLIT) (vworld.kr)\n- Statistical Geographic Information System (SGIS) plus (Ministry of Data and Statistics, MODS) (sgis.mods.go.kr)\n- Address-based Industry Support Service (Ministry of the Interior and Safety, MOIS) (business.juso.go.kr)\n- Aviation statistics 2025 (Korea Civil Aviation Association, KCAA) (airportal.go.kr)\n- Korean railroad statistics 2024 (Korea Railroad, KORAIL) (railstat.korail.com)\n- Korean Public Transportation Database (Korea Transportation Safety Authority, KTSA) (kotsa.or.kr)\n- Korean Hospital and Pharmacy Status (Health Insurance Review and Assessment Service, HIRA) (data.go.kr)\n- Health Insurance Medical Statistics (HIRA) (opendata.hira.or.kr)\n- Academy Information System (Ministry of Education, MOE) (academyinfo.go.kr)\n\n## Credits\n\nMap authored by budhakr",
